<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Shoulders for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>The best shoulder option available are the tier shoulders <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78836/spiritwalkers-shoulderwraps">
