<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Wrist for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>There are not many good options for this slot, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77319/bracers-of-the-spectral-wolf">
<img alt="Bracers of the Spectral Wolf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Spectral Wolf</span></a> being the best option from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
