<img alt="Opal of the Secret Order" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Opal of the Secret Order</span></a> for pure Elemental are the best options, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78382/petrified-fungal-heart">
<img alt="Petrified Fungal Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Fungal Heart</span></a> also being good if you cannot afford the Valor.<div class="pad"></div>
