<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Rings for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77109/band-of-reconstruction">
<img alt="Band of Reconstruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Reconstruction</span></a> is a great option if you enjoy going Restoration occasionally, while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77108/seal-of-the-grand-architect">
<img alt="Seal of the Grand Architect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Grand Architect</span></a> is better for pure Elemental. Combine one of these with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78427/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a> for the pre-raid best in slot.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78496/signet-of-suturing">
<img alt="Signet of Suturing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Suturing</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71211/soothing-brimstone-circle">
<img alt="Soothing Brimstone Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_02c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soothing Brimstone Circle</span></a> are also decent placeholders.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a>
