<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Elemental Shaman DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staff-weapons-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Staff Weapons for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>While you should not usually use staves, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78486/titahk-the-steps-of-time">
