<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Off Hands for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>While you can also use off-hands, we recommend using shields as the competition is lower and you will get free armor along with the usual throughput stats. You can get the best shield, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78458/timepiece-of-the-bronze-flight">
